      "side": 1,
      "message": "it may be simpler to just always set `strippedAllOutputFile` regardless of the dist tags. Because since it\u0027s now an output file, other soong modules can depend on it, but only if this module is diffed under the stripped_all tag, which is confusing behavior.",
