        "id": 1535516
      },
      "writtenOn": "2023-11-02T18:30:12Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Other modules can depend on it from their bp file by saying `srcs: [\":mymodule{stripped-all}\"]`. You aren\u0027t preventing that. But as is, that will error out unless people add the dist tag with `stripped-all`. I think we should allow people to depend on the stripped output without adding the dist tag so that we don\u0027t have people adding unnecessary dist tags.",
      "parentUuid": "c455b936_2d4d27ad",
      "revId": "4b86c05b4cebc67d5d96604d792fbff1a12cc485",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": false,
